{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your city fully, unleash your creative potential! You can build something from a house to a factory on the green map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARN COINS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn PixelCoins and complete the final build to beat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SAVE &amp; SEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the game at the end and share the save file with someone! It becomes easier with the built-in exporting system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete them for extra challenges, but still go creative!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IT'S STILL A SANDBOX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to build a city or a town - or even a country, this game is for you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776980?t=1772399198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3776980?t=1772399198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776980/1f233a8480d622d7d0c0ab8e52484d68135b1b39/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772399198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776980/1f233a8480d622d7d0c0ab8e52484d68135b1b39/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772399198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL CUSTOMIZATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cu